<title>USA: Iron Mountain completes acquisition.</title>
<headline>Iron Mountain completes acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>BOSTON 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iron Mountain Inc said it has completed its acquisition of Safesite Records Management Corp for stock and cash.</p>
<p>Under the deal, Iron Mountain will issue about 1.8 million shares of common stock and pay about $12 million in cash. Iron Mountain's stock closed Thursday at $29 per share.</p>
<p>Safesite and Iron Mountain are records management companies.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
